OL,3,AChris Mason: The US elections will
OL,4,Achange Trump - how will Burnham react?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first public words from the prime
OL,7,Fminister after the American midterm
OL,8,Felections were instantly revealing
OL,9,Fabout contemporary international
OL,10,Fpolitics and diplomacy.
OL,12,F"Well, President Trump has accepted the
OL,13,Fresults," Andy Burnham said.
OL,15,FIt is not an observation British
OL,16,Fleaders have frequently had to make
OL,17,Fabout recent American presidents ` that
OL,18,Fthey are not disputing the result of
OL,19,Felections in their own country. But
OL,20,Fwhat would previously have been taken
OL,21,Ffor granted no longer can be.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
